      <li style="font-size: 1rem; color: #0D2137; line-height: 1.6;">
        <strong>Enter your countable savings and investments.</strong> Sum your checking/savings balances, stocks, bonds, and IRAs. Do NOT include your primary home, your car, or personal belongings.
      </li>
