            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0D2137;">Value</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">Monthly Income</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">$1,720 (Limit: $1,985)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="background: #f6f8fa;">
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">Countable Assets</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">$8,000 net ($9,500 − $1,500 burial limit)</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #0D2137; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
        <strong>Result:</strong> Margaret qualified for <span style="color: #E8761A; font-weight: 700;">Full Extra Help</span>. Her monthly drug plan premium dropped from $48 to <strong>$0</strong>, and her monthly medication copays dropped from $190 to <strong>$24.50 total</strong>.
      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #0D2137; line-height: 1.6;">
        <strong>Action Taken:</strong> Margaret applied online at <code>ssa.gov/extrahelp</code>. Her application was approved within 3 weeks, saving her <strong>$2,562 per year</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Scenario 2 -->
    <div style="background: #f8fafc; border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 0.75rem; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.25rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #0A3D3A; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;">Arthur &amp; Evelyn, 72 &amp; 70 — Married Couple on Fixed Income</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #0D2137; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Arthur and Evelyn have a combined Social Security income of $2,450/month and $22,000 in checking. Evelyn takes a high-cost brand-name inhaler.
      </p>
      <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        <tbody>
          <tr style="background: #e8f4f1;">
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0D2137;">Input</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0D2137;">Value</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">Monthly Income</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">$2,450 (Limit: $2,685)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="background: #f6f8fa;">
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">Countable Assets</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; color: #0D2137;">$19,000 net ($22,000 − $3,000 burial limit)</td>
          </tr>
