      </p>
      <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #0D2137; line-height: 1.6;">
        <strong>Action Taken:</strong> Arthur completed the SSA Extra Help paper form and mailed it in. Total annual household savings exceeded <strong>$4,100</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 0.825rem; color: #4B5A6E; margin-top: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.6;">
      These are representative scenarios based on official 2026 Social Security Extra Help standards. Individual determinations are made by Social Security upon official application.
    </p>
